      "contextBefore": "```swift\noptional func peripheralManagerIsReady(toUpdateSubscribers peripheral: CBPeripheralManager)\n```",
      "contextAfter": "When a call to the [`updateValue(_:for:onSubscribedCentrals:)`](cbperipheralmanager/updatevalue(_:for:onsubscribedcentrals:).md) method fails because the underlying queue used to transmit the updated characteristic value is full, Core Bluetooth calls the [`peripheralManagerIsReady(toUpdateSubscribers:)`](cbperipheralmanagerdelegate/peripheralmanagerisready(toupdatesubscribers:).md) method when more space in the transmit queue becomes available.",
